  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Border Security Force (BSF)</a></span> has released the result for the post of Constable (Tradesman). This recruitment was released for 3588 posts. Applications for the BSF Constable Tradesman Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 24 July 2025, to 26 August 2025. The PET/ PST examination was held on December 2025. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their BSF Constable Tradesman PET/ PST Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Border Security Force (BSF)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BSF Constable Tradesman PET/ PST Result 2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>25 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>23 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>23 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Edit Application Form : <strong>26 August 2025 – 28 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PET/ PST Exam Date : <strong>December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET/ PST Admit Card : <strong>12 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET/ PST Result : <strong>10 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, SC :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Female :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSF Constable Tradesman Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 23 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per BSF Constable Tradesman Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSF Constable Tradesman 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 3588 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.066%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6033%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.066%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Constable (Tradesman)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6033%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Male</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">3406</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6033%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Female</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">182</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9999%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Check Trade Wise &amp; Category Wise Vacancy Details – <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/BSF-Constable-Tradesman-Category-Wise-Vacancy-Details.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BSF Constable Tradesman Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class Passed 10th or its Equivalent from any recognized Board in India with ITI in relevant trade &amp; have 2 Years Experience will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BSF Constable Tradesman Recruitment 2025 : <strong>Physical Eligibility</strong></b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.4898%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gender&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.5102%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Physical Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.4898%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Male</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.5102%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Height :</strong> 165 Cms (Gen/OBC/EWS/SC), 160 Cms (ST)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Chest :</strong> 75-80 Cms (All Candidates)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Race :</strong> 5 Km in 24 Minutes</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.4898%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Female</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.5102%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Height :</strong> 155 Cms (Gen/OBC/EWS/SC), 148 Cms (ST)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Race :</strong> 1.6 KM in 8 minutes 30 seconds</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download BSF Constable Tradesman Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Result link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download their result download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSF Constable Tradesman Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET &amp; PST Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Trade / Skill Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download PET/ PST Result</strong></span></h4>\n</td